      "description_en": "Specifies whether to only check the authorization status. Valid values:\n\n- true: Only checks the authorization status without creating a service-linked role.\n- false: Checks the authorization status. If Auto Scaling is not authorized to operate on ECS or Elastic Container Instance (ECI) resources, a service-linked role is associated through automatic creation.\n\nDefault value: false.",
